Package: outfindr
Type: Package
Title: Outlier Detection Using IQR, Range, and KNN
Version: 1.0.0
Author: Soohyun Yoon, Wendy Shue
Maintainer: Soohyun Yoon <soo.yoon@mail.utoronto.ca>, Wendy Shue <wendy.shue@mail.utoronto>
Description: Flags outliers in data frames using the Interquartile Range (IQR), 
    user-specified ranges, or K-Nearest Neighbors (KNN).
